Some classes, including Wizards, start with zero alignment.  If you
have zero alignment, there is a chance that your god won't answer your
prayers, even though you meet all the other criteria for praying
successfully.  The message "Thoth is satisfied" indicates that this is
what happened to Boudewijn.

The easiest way to raise your alignment is to kill hostile monsters.
I'm not sure, but I think that this works better if they are not
co-aligned with you.  (There is a comment in the source that "It's
never bad to kill a hostile monster, though it may not be good.")
